List, show, apply, and import agent profiles.

Usage:
  strap agents list
  strap agents show chat-concise
  strap agents apply chat-concise < state.json > next.json
  strap agents roots
  strap agents import-opencode ~/.config/opencode/agents

Agents are markdown files with optional OpenCode-style frontmatter. They are discovered from `.strap-user/agents`, `.strap/agents`, config agents, and root agents.
